# Crowd-Control Warden counts only the OTHER creatures you control: the Warden itself is not counted, and an opponent's creatures are not either. Bot2 casts an Ornithopter on turn 2; on turn 3 Bot1 casts the Warden face up
# with no other creature, so X = 0 and it is a 4/4 with no +1/+1 counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
